1. Constructor                         <-- instantiation
2. @Autowired field/setter population  <-- dependency injection
3. BeanNameAware / BeanFactoryAware / ApplicationContextAware
4. BeanPostProcessor.postProcessBeforeInitialization  <-- e.g. @PostConstruct discoverers
