// What gets auto-configured just by these dependencies in pom.xml
// spring-boot-starter-web        -> Spring MVC + Jackson + embedded Tomcat
// spring-boot-starter-data-jpa   -> Hibernate + HikariCP + transaction manager
// spring-boot-starter-security   -> Spring Security filter chain
